<title>USA: McDonnell Douglas Corp Q1 net down.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Douglas Corp Q1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.86		    $0.89</p>
<p> Net			181,000		  198,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,230,000		3,171,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 209,900		  222,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 total costs, expenses were $2,942,000 vs $2,855,000.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
